<title>NETHERLANDS: Philips restrucuturing some TV operations.</title>
<headline>Philips restrucuturing some TV operations.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philips Electronics NV said on Thursday it was restrucuturing television operations in Belgium, France and Italy as part of a previously announced restructuring of its Sound and Vision unit.</p>
<p>It said jobs at the three sites would fall by 50 percent to around 1,400 as a result of the restructuring in 1997.</p>
</text>
